<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has again carried out airstrikes in Syria, saying they targeted Islamic State hideouts linked to a recent church attack that killed nine people, but the strikes also hit civilian areas, prompting Syrian condemnation as a breach of airspace. Syrian authorities report civilian casualties from the Jordanian attacks. The Jordanian government maintains the operations are aimed at militants, while families of the victims deny any connection to the church attack. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/27/world/middleeast/jordan-syria-strikes-attack.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOMHQzNHdfOFBHVDBqV3VvMGtQVHlJcXM0R3hxZElIaTQzUXFqRVZOY2kwenhlQVJ5Q3ZDMlIteG9pZGFyaWJhV1NnMDlKMGNxT0pMMjduenU0WVpsWEdTc2ljbFF4R2pkSk5zVGdVMkJoQkx4ckt6TU9IRzBUVTQ2VXAyMEtmYjQ0ZDJWelhvaUt2UkoxOVpSdExpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/unacceptable-violation-syria-condemns-jordan-airstrikes&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPaC1wSFN3LWZBWHFwQVJzMl9nNlAzY2NzaE91MzNYWlp5M0RDaEFORE1fT25KZGFxa0QxbHRxb25QLXlUUE9ITnljbjBDSmpfUXVISWEyQkx3RWQzM3FRaHlTbkRTOW5ZTkJHWGFQUDRYSHhhVXI2aWNVWmc4NU5hNFprNFA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
